{title: Shudhu Tomari Jonyo}
{artist: Arijit Singh Shreya Ghoshal}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D] Hote pari roddurr, hote pari,        brishti? hote pari [Bm]
rasta tomaari jo [Am] nay,        Hote pari [D] bodnam? hote pari
daknaam, hote pari [Bm] soti, tomaari,        jo [A] nne
Hote pari [D] gol po tumi kachhe,        [Bm] tanle, hote pari
[F#m] jaanla eyi ha [Em] wwa o tomar,        karo [A] ne
Shudhu tumi [D] chau jodi,        Sajaabo [E] abar nodi
Shudhu tumi [D] chau jodi,        Sajaabo [E] abar nodi
Eshechi hazaar baaro [A] ne,        Shu [D] dhu to [C] mari
jo [G] nne Suuh [D] dhu to [C] maari,        jo [D] nne [A]
Shu [D] dhu to [C] mari,        jo [G] nne Suuh [D] dhu to [C] maari
jo [D] nne,        Kotha dilo roddurr, kohta dilo brishti,
kotha dilo [Bm] rasta tomari jo [A] nney,        Kheladhulo song [D] shar ashaa jaowa bar-bar
Raaji holo [Bm] icche tomari jon [A] ne,        Hote pari [D] golpo tumi kache [Bm] tanle
Hote pari [F#m] jaanla ei hao [Em] wa o tomar,        kar [A] on
Sudhu tumi [D] chaau jodi,        Sajaabo [E] abar nodi
Shudhu tumi [D] chaau jodi,        Sajaabo a [E] bar nodi
Eshechi hazaar baro [A] ne,        Shuuu [D] dhu to [C] mari jo [G] nne Shuu [D] dhu
to [C] mari jo [D] nne [A],        Shuuu [D] dhu to [C] mari jo [G] nne Shuu [D] dhu
to [C] mari jo [D] nne
